  abilityName: Champion's Onslaught
  abilityDesc: 5 combo powerful Fire attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining
    HP), massive Fire attack on single foe, enormously boosts Atk, Def and enormously
    boosts critical hit rate for 3 turns, hugely boosts Atk relative to Def for 3
    turns, probable huge 2 turn Atk, Def reduction & hugely boosts critical damage
    for 3 turns
